For anyone following this, the solution seems to be relatively trivial.

If a symlink for /opt is put in /Developer/SDKs/MacOSX10.4u.sdk , then
RdbiPgSQL compiles fine.  It turns out that the isysroot option
prepends its value to all paths.  This is something which apple has
done, and it is debatable whether this is a bug or a feature.

