From jmacdon at med.umich.edu  Fri May 18 20:17:51 2007
From: jmacdon at med.umich.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Fri, 18 May 2007 14:17:51 -0400
Subject: [BioC] Is a change in kit significant?
In-Reply-To: <464DCDB5.5060403@icr.ac.uk>
References: <4641EB21.8030401@icr.ac.uk>
